<p>One correction.  While Bernays and Freud believed him, this idea of humanity as a crazy herd was actually Dr. Totter. His ideas were not just used by the capitalist marketers as the example above, but simultaneously by the communists as well. So while marketing must obviously have some true premise, the cornerstone of it&#8217;s blanket justification have been used by the full spectrum of left and right to justify the destruction of the other.</p>
